#: includes/class-gatecha-cloud.php:76
msgid "No GateCHA server yet?"
msgstr "Pas encore de serveur GateCHA ?"

#: includes/class-gatecha-cloud.php:77
msgid ""
"This plugin checks your forms through a GateCHA server. Host one yourself, "
"free and open source, or let us host it for you."
msgstr ""
"Cette extension vérifie vos formulaires grâce à un serveur GateCHA. Hébergez-"
"le vous-même, c'est gratuit et open source, ou laissez-nous l'héberger pour "
"vous."

#: includes/class-gatecha-cloud.php:81
msgid "Use GateCHA Cloud"
msgstr "Utiliser GateCHA Cloud"

#: includes/class-gatecha-cloud.php:82
msgid "Host it yourself (free)"
msgstr "L'héberger moi-même (gratuit)"

#: includes/class-gatecha-cloud.php:85
msgid ""
"GateCHA Cloud is hosted in France, with a free 30-day trial and no card "
"needed. You come back here with everything filled in."
msgstr ""
"GateCHA Cloud est hébergé en France, avec 30 jours d'essai gratuits et sans "
"carte bancaire. Vous revenez ici avec tout déjà rempli."

#. translators: %s: host name of the GateCHA Cloud service
#: includes/class-gatecha-cloud.php:89
#, php-format
